  "details": "Sometimes I feel like occluding avatars or avatars not being visible leads still to a drop in framerate that is almost equal to actually seing them. I use occlusion culling in worlds, but with a lot of people in a world, this doesnt seem to affect performance positively still. The lagging/framerate decrease is still so high, even though everyone is far out of reach. This was better once and at some point I feel like it got worse.",
